# Project:   dfe-engine
# File:      .dockerignore
# Purpose:   Trim the Docker build context and strip submodule gitlinks
# Language:  Docker ignore
#
# License:   BUSL-1.1
# Copyright: (c) 2026 HYPERI PTY LIMITED
#
# The image bakes the config/ (dfe-devex) and schemas/ (dfe-schemas) submodule
# trees. Their .git gitlink files must not be copied in - dulwich would try to
# open a gitdir that does not exist in the image. Excluding **/.git also keeps
# the superproject .git out of the build context.

**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
htmlcov
.coverage

# Secrets and local env MUST NEVER enter the build context. The real .env and a
# live ES384 JWT signing key under .secrets/ were both present in the context
# (verified 2026-07-19, #106 P1.4) - kept out of the image today only by the
# selective COPY lines, one edit away from a leak. Excluded here so a COPY . .
# cannot pick them up.
.env
.env.*
.secrets

# Build-context weight (#106 P2.6): tests/ alone was 118 MB of a 129 MB context.
# None of this belongs in the image.
tests/
docs/
.github
.tmp
coverage.xml
cov.xml
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*
